# ============================================================
# RQ1: ADHD GROUP, SELF-ENDANGERING WORK BEHAVIOR,
#      AND BURNOUT, WORK ENGAGEMENT, AND PERCEIVED STRESS
#
# This script reproduces:
#   1. ADHD-group differences in the 10 SEWB dimensions
#   2. Multicollinearity diagnostics
